    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 5-week breakdown from Gorakhpur: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 32 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Gorakhpur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—no weird sugary syrup base or artificial flavoring—just pure tulsi ark, and over the past 5 weeks it tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Gorakhpur, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 32 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Gorakhpur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—no weird sugary syrup base or artificial flavoring—just pure tulsi ark, and over the past 5 weeks it tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Gorakhpur, and a little product goes a long way.",
