    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar for 4 weeks here in Gorakhpur",
    "body": "Living in Gorakhpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it pulls out summer grime and sunscreen residue while the aloe keeps skin soft, while the aloe vera cushion makes a huge difference compared to drying market soaps. Even better, doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. Post-gym showers hit different when your soap actually clears sweat instead of just masking it.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Gorakhpur with a verifiable batch code. What kind of soap saver tray works best to make the bar last longest?",
    "comment": "Living in Gorakhpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it pulls out summer grime and sunscreen residue while the aloe keeps skin soft, while the aloe vera cushion makes a huge difference compared to drying market soaps. Even better, doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. Post-gym showers hit different when your soap actually clears sweat instead of just masking it.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Gorakhpur with a verifiable batch code. What kind of soap saver tray works best to make the bar last longest?",
