    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 4 weeks here in Karwar",
    "body": "Living in Karwar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while pairing this internally with my skincare routine genuinely calmed my stress breakouts. Even better, adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home. One tiny 30ml bottle outlasted three giant syrup bottles in our kitchen cabinet.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Karwar with a verifiable batch code. Do you recommend taking this on an empty stomach or after breakfast?",
