    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Activated Charcoal Face Wash for 8 weeks here in Rohini",
    "body": "Living in Rohini, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Activated Charcoal Face Wash 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it has a subtle earthy herbal scent instead of synthetic perfume that irritates eyes, while the 5% glycerin cushion really stops that post-wash dryness. Even better, clears out evening traffic dust and T-zone grease without making my cheeks feel tight. Bought this for my post-bike-ride dust, and now my brother uses half the bottle without asking.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Rohini with a verifiable batch code. Can I pair this at night with the Sea Buckthorn cleanser in the morning?",
