    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 8 weeks here in Durg",
    "body": "Living in Durg, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while pairing this internally with my skincare routine genuinely calmed my stress breakouts. Even better, noticeably helped with my digestion and stress-related bloating after meals. One tiny 30ml bottle outlasted three giant syrup bottles in our kitchen cabinet.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Durg with a verifiable batch code. What is the best age for kids to take 1-2 diluted drops in water?",
