    "title": "A grounded 5-week breakdown from Guwahati: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 32 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Guwahati, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the fresh tulsi and neem notes make morning showers super relaxing, and over the past 5 weeks it doesn't dry out my skin even when showering twice a day in peak heat. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Guwahati, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 32 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Guwahati, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the fresh tulsi and neem notes make morning showers super relaxing, and over the past 5 weeks it doesn't dry out my skin even when showering twice a day in peak heat. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Guwahati, and a little product goes a long way.",
