    "body": "Living in Bhilai, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Activated Charcoal Face Wash 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it has a subtle earthy herbal scent instead of synthetic perfume that irritates eyes, while even one pump is enough after riding through dusty streets. Even better, clears out evening traffic dust and T-zone grease without making my cheeks feel tight. My roommate quietly retired his neon-green supermarket tube after borrowing this twice.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Bhilai with a verifiable batch code. Are you guys planning a 200ml pump bottle for this anytime soon?",
