    "rating": 4,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo for 8 weeks here in Aurangabad",
    "body": "Living in Aurangabad, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it saves so much time on busy weekday mornings since I can skip conditioning, while combing through wet hair after towel drying is way easier now. Even better, leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. My husband started using it for his helmet-sweat scalp and now we need a second bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Aurangabad with a verifiable batch code. Would love a matching herbal hair mist or oil from the same line soon! Took 5 days to arrive in Aurangabad, but the packaging was neat and the formula easily earns its keep.",
    "comment": "Living in Aurangabad, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it saves so much time on busy weekday mornings since I can skip conditioning, while combing through wet hair after towel drying is way easier now. Even better, leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. My husband started using it for his helmet-sweat scalp and now we need a second bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Aurangabad with a verifiable batch code. Would love a matching herbal hair mist or oil from the same line soon! Took 5 days to arrive in Aurangabad, but the packaging was neat and the formula easily earns its keep.",
