    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 2 weeks here in Rajahmundry",
    "body": "Living in Rajahmundry, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue, while the hyaluronic acid and sea buckthorn oil keep the skin barrier super happy. Even better, softened the dry patches around my mouth from sitting in AC all day. Finally look like I slept 8 hours even when I was up scrolling till 2 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Rajahmundry with a verifiable batch code. Will you be launching a matching Sea Buckthorn leave-on serum to layer after this?",
