    "title": "A grounded 3-week breakdown from Panaji: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 18 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Panaji, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites, which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—rinses off cleanly without any tight or squeaky-stripped feeling, and over the past 3 weeks it super gentle on reactive skin that gets itchy from heavily perfumed market soaps. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Panaji, and a little product goes a long way.",
