    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 7-week breakdown from Nellore: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 18 days of using the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo in Nellore, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—massaging it in with water for two minutes gives a really clean, herbal wash, and over the past 7 weeks it the reetha and amla lather is mild, natural, and doesn't frizz up my curls. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Nellore, and a little product goes a long way.",
