    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 2 weeks here in Thrissur",
    "body": "Living in Thrissur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it just 3 to 4 drops in warm water every morning completely settled my seasonal throat irritation, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Thrissur with a verifiable batch code. Is it okay to take this twice daily during heavy monsoon flu season?",
    "comment": "Living in Thrissur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it just 3 to 4 drops in warm water every morning completely settled my seasonal throat irritation, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Thrissur with a verifiable batch code. Is it okay to take this twice daily during heavy monsoon flu season?",
