    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 44 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Thanjavur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—you can actually tell there are no harsh synthetic detergents in the base, and over the past 9 weeks it helped settle the redness on my arms after long hours in the sun. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Thanjavur, and a little product goes a long way. Took 5 days to arrive in Thanjavur, but the packaging was neat and the formula easily earns its keep.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 44 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Thanjavur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—you can actually tell there are no harsh synthetic detergents in the base, and over the past 9 weeks it helped settle the redness on my arms after long hours in the sun. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Thanjavur, and a little product goes a long way. Took 5 days to arrive in Thanjavur, but the packaging was neat and the formula easily earns its keep.",
