    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 8 weeks here in Patna",
    "body": "Living in Patna, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, while honestly feels more like a hydrating treatment than a basic wash. Even better, feels super soothing on sensitive cheeks that usually flush with normal cleansers. Ordered it for my dull winter skin and my mom immediately claimed it for her morning routine.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Patna with a verifiable batch code. How long should I leave it on the skin before rinsing for best results?",
    "comment": "Living in Patna, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, while honestly feels more like a hydrating treatment than a basic wash. Even better, feels super soothing on sensitive cheeks that usually flush with normal cleansers. Ordered it for my dull winter skin and my mom immediately claimed it for her morning routine.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Patna with a verifiable batch code. How long should I leave it on the skin before rinsing for best results?",
