    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 8 weeks here in Kothrud",
    "body": "Living in Kothrud, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too. Even better, tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kothrud with a verifiable batch code. Is it okay to take this twice daily during heavy monsoon flu season?",
    "comment": "Living in Kothrud, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too. Even better, tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kothrud with a verifiable batch code. Is it okay to take this twice daily during heavy monsoon flu season?",
