    "body": "Living in Bardhaman, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar 6 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it natural herbal fragrance that feels like an authentic home-crafted bath bar, while leaves a subtle cooling comfort on the skin during muggy afternoons. Even better, helped settle the redness on my arms after long hours in the sun. My grandmother approved the neem-tulsi blend, which is the highest certification in our house.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Bardhaman with a verifiable batch code. Can this be used for teenagers dealing with summer body breakouts?",
