    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar for 2 weeks here in Junagadh",
    "body": "Living in Junagadh, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleared up stubborn back acne and post-workout sweat congestion in a few weeks, while it has a clean, grounded botanical scent that lingers lightly after a shower. Even better, doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. Post-gym showers hit different when your soap actually clears sweat instead of just masking it.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Junagadh with a verifiable batch code. Do you offer a 3-bar or 4-bar value pack for families?",
    "comment": "Living in Junagadh, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleared up stubborn back acne and post-workout sweat congestion in a few weeks, while it has a clean, grounded botanical scent that lingers lightly after a shower. Even better, doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. Post-gym showers hit different when your soap actually clears sweat instead of just masking it.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Junagadh with a verifiable batch code. Do you offer a 3-bar or 4-bar value pack for families?",
