    "title": "A grounded 9-week breakdown from Margao: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 40 days of using the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo in Margao, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the rosemary and bhringraj blend smells genuinely earthy and calming, and over the past 9 weeks it kept my scalp fresh for three full days even with daily helmet commutes. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Margao, and a little product goes a long way.",
