    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 4 weeks here in Krishnanagar",
    "body": "Living in Krishnanagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while you only need 3-4 drops because the 90% extract concentration is super strong. Even better, great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. One tiny 30ml bottle outlasted three giant syrup bottles in our kitchen cabinet.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Krishnanagar with a verifiable batch code. Do you recommend taking this on an empty stomach or after breakfast?",
    "comment": "Living in Krishnanagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while you only need 3-4 drops because the 90% extract concentration is super strong. Even better, great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. One tiny 30ml bottle outlasted three giant syrup bottles in our kitchen cabinet.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Krishnanagar with a verifiable batch code. Do you recommend taking this on an empty stomach or after breakfast?",
