    "title": "A grounded 9-week breakdown from Krishnanagar: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 16 days of using the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo in Krishnanagar, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—my hair dries soft and manageable without that coated waxy feel, and over the past 9 weeks it kept my scalp fresh for three full days even with daily helmet commutes. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Krishnanagar, and a little product goes a long way.",
