    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 4 weeks here in Kalimpong",
    "body": "Living in Kalimpong, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel, while honestly feels more like a hydrating treatment than a basic wash. Even better, the golden gel texture glides on gently and leaves skin bouncy and hydrated. Ordered it for my dull winter skin and my mom immediately claimed it for her morning routine.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kalimpong with a verifiable batch code. How long should I leave it on the skin before rinsing for best results?",
