    "combo_sku": null,
    "rating": 4,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo for 8 weeks here in Secunderabad",
    "body": "Living in Secunderabad, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it saves so much time on busy weekday mornings since I can skip conditioning, while it doesn't strip natural oils from the lengths like sulfate shampoos do. Even better, actually detangles my hair in borewell hard water without needing a separate conditioner. My comb and my shower drain are both having a much calmer month thanks to this bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Secunderabad with a verifiable batch code. How many times a week do you recommend using this for an oily scalp? Giving 4 stars since I'd love a larger family-size refill pack next time, otherwise zero complaints in Secunderabad.",
    "comment": "Living in Secunderabad, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it saves so much time on busy weekday mornings since I can skip conditioning, while it doesn't strip natural oils from the lengths like sulfate shampoos do. Even better, actually detangles my hair in borewell hard water without needing a separate conditioner. My comb and my shower drain are both having a much calmer month thanks to this bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Secunderabad with a verifiable batch code. How many times a week do you recommend using this for an oily scalp? Giving 4 stars since I'd love a larger family-size refill pack next time, otherwise zero complaints in Secunderabad.",
