    "title": "A grounded 3-week breakdown from Visakhapatnam: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 28 days of using the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar in Visakhapatnam, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the aloe vera cushion makes a huge difference compared to drying market soaps, and over the past 3 weeks it doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Visakhapatnam, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 28 days of using the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar in Visakhapatnam, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the aloe vera cushion makes a huge difference compared to drying market soaps, and over the past 3 weeks it doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Visakhapatnam, and a little product goes a long way.",
