    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 20 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Ajmer, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water, and over the past 3 weeks it way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Ajmer, and a little product goes a long way.",
