    "title": "A grounded 3-week breakdown from Jabalpur: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 26 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Jabalpur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—rinses off cleanly without any tight or squeaky-stripped feeling, and over the past 3 weeks it super gentle on reactive skin that gets itchy from heavily perfumed market soaps. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Jabalpur, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 26 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Jabalpur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—rinses off cleanly without any tight or squeaky-stripped feeling, and over the past 3 weeks it super gentle on reactive skin that gets itchy from heavily perfumed market soaps. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Jabalpur, and a little product goes a long way.",
