    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar for 4 weeks here in Gorakhpur",
    "body": "Living in Gorakhpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the neem, tulsi, and aloe combination keeps skin cool, clean, and hydrated, while the fresh tulsi and neem notes make morning showers super relaxing. Even better, holds its shape nicely on a drained tray and gives a soft, creamy lather. Prickly heat season usually wins every year, but this neem-tulsi bar actually fought back.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Gorakhpur with a verifiable batch code. How long is the shelf life if I stock up on four bars at once?",
    "comment": "Living in Gorakhpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the neem, tulsi, and aloe combination keeps skin cool, clean, and hydrated, while the fresh tulsi and neem notes make morning showers super relaxing. Even better, holds its shape nicely on a drained tray and gives a soft, creamy lather. Prickly heat season usually wins every year, but this neem-tulsi bar actually fought back.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Gorakhpur with a verifiable batch code. How long is the shelf life if I stock up on four bars at once?",
