    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 2 weeks here in Chennai",
    "body": "Living in Chennai, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue, while the natural citrus-herbal aroma feels like a quick morning reset. Even better, gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Chennai with a verifiable batch code. Do you guys plan on releasing a bigger refill pack for daily users?",
    "comment": "Living in Chennai, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue, while the natural citrus-herbal aroma feels like a quick morning reset. Even better, gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Chennai with a verifiable batch code. Do you guys plan on releasing a bigger refill pack for daily users?",
