    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 3-week breakdown from Srinagar: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 56 days of using the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash in Srinagar, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—it never triggers redness around my nose the way foaming gels do, and over the past 3 weeks it softened the dry patches around my mouth from sitting in AC all day. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Srinagar, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 56 days of using the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash in Srinagar, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—it never triggers redness around my nose the way foaming gels do, and over the past 3 weeks it softened the dry patches around my mouth from sitting in AC all day. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Srinagar, and a little product goes a long way.",
