    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 2 weeks here in Mapusa",
    "body": "Living in Mapusa, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it just 3 to 4 drops in warm water every morning completely settled my seasonal throat irritation, while the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. My parents now guard this dropper bottle like family treasure every morning at 7 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Mapusa with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
    "comment": "Living in Mapusa, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it just 3 to 4 drops in warm water every morning completely settled my seasonal throat irritation, while the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. My parents now guard this dropper bottle like family treasure every morning at 7 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Mapusa with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
