    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-DAILY-01",
    "rating": 4,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo for 4 weeks here in Durgapur",
    "body": "Living in Durgapur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleans out scalp sweat and light hair oil while keeping the ends soft, while massaging it in with water for two minutes gives a really clean, herbal wash. Even better, leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. Hard water here usually turns my hair into a broom—this actually made it behave.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Durgapur with a verifiable batch code. Would love a matching herbal hair mist or oil from the same line soon! Took 5 days to arrive in Durgapur, but the packaging was neat and the formula easily earns its keep.",
    "comment": "Living in Durgapur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleans out scalp sweat and light hair oil while keeping the ends soft, while massaging it in with water for two minutes gives a really clean, herbal wash. Even better, leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. Hard water here usually turns my hair into a broom—this actually made it behave.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Durgapur with a verifiable batch code. Would love a matching herbal hair mist or oil from the same line soon! Took 5 days to arrive in Durgapur, but the packaging was neat and the formula easily earns its keep.",
