    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 8 weeks here in Kakkanad",
    "body": "Living in Kakkanad, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, while it rinses clean with zero slippery film left behind. Even better, doesn't sting or strip my barrier even when the weather turns dry. Good to find a brightening wash that doesn't smell like a chemical candy shop.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kakkanad with a verifiable batch code. How long should I leave it on the skin before rinsing for best results?",
