    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar for 8 weeks here in Raniganj",
    "body": "Living in Raniganj, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it holds its shape nicely on a drained tray and gives a soft, creamy lather, while my dry, sensitive patches stopped flaking after switching to this bar. Even better, calmed down my prickly heat and summer sweat rashes within a week. Bought one bar to test on my sensitive skin and now the whole family has switched over.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Raniganj with a verifiable batch code. Do you use cold-pressed neem extract in this bar as well?",
