    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 5-week breakdown from Bengaluru: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 26 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Bengaluru, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites, which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too, and over the past 5 weeks it tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Bengaluru, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 26 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Bengaluru, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites, which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too, and over the past 5 weeks it tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Bengaluru, and a little product goes a long way.",
