    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-DAILY-01",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 8 weeks here in Vellore",
    "body": "Living in Vellore, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, while it rinses clean with zero slippery film left behind. Even better, gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel. Ordered it for my dull winter skin and my mom immediately claimed it for her morning routine.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Vellore with a verifiable batch code. Do you guys plan on releasing a bigger refill pack for daily users?",
    "comment": "Living in Vellore, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, while it rinses clean with zero slippery film left behind. Even better, gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel. Ordered it for my dull winter skin and my mom immediately claimed it for her morning routine.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Vellore with a verifiable batch code. Do you guys plan on releasing a bigger refill pack for daily users?",
