    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-DAILY-01",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 8 weeks here in Srinagar",
    "body": "Living in Srinagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, while the natural citrus-herbal aroma feels like a quick morning reset. Even better, keeps my combination skin comfortable from morning right through evening. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Srinagar with a verifiable batch code. Is this gentle enough to use twice a day during dry winter months?",
    "comment": "Living in Srinagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, while the natural citrus-herbal aroma feels like a quick morning reset. Even better, keeps my combination skin comfortable from morning right through evening. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Srinagar with a verifiable batch code. Is this gentle enough to use twice a day during dry winter months?",
