    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 9-week breakdown from Bhubaneswar: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 40 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Bhubaneswar, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—pairing this internally with my skincare routine genuinely calmed my stress breakouts, and over the past 9 weeks it great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Bhubaneswar, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 40 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Bhubaneswar, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—pairing this internally with my skincare routine genuinely calmed my stress breakouts, and over the past 9 weeks it great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Bhubaneswar, and a little product goes a long way.",
