    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Activated Charcoal Face Wash for 2 weeks here in Darbhanga",
    "body": "Living in Darbhanga, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Activated Charcoal Face Wash 2 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it clears out evening traffic dust and T-zone grease without making my cheeks feel tight, while I don't have to rush for moisturizer the second I towel dry. Even better, lifts forehead oil and tiny bumps after a long commute without stripping moisture. Survived a full week of peak traffic dust without a single new breakout, which feels like a minor miracle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Darbhanga with a verifiable batch code. Can I pair this at night with the Sea Buckthorn cleanser in the morning?",
