    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 6 weeks here in Rishikesh",
    "body": "Living in Rishikesh, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Rishikesh with a verifiable batch code. What is the best age for kids to take 1-2 diluted drops in water? Knocking off one star only because the courier took 4 days to reach Rishikesh, though the product itself is spot on.",
    "comment": "Living in Rishikesh, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Rishikesh with a verifiable batch code. What is the best age for kids to take 1-2 diluted drops in water? Knocking off one star only because the courier took 4 days to reach Rishikesh, though the product itself is spot on.",
