    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 4 weeks here in Ajmer",
    "body": "Living in Ajmer, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel, while it never triggers redness around my nose the way foaming gels do. Even better, gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue. Ordered it for my dull winter skin and my mom immediately claimed it for her morning routine.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Ajmer with a verifiable batch code. How long should I leave it on the skin before rinsing for best results?",
