    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 24 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Jodhpur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—gentle pH balance really shows when your skin doesn't itch after towel drying, and over the past 9 weeks it helped settle the redness on my arms after long hours in the sun. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Jodhpur, and a little product goes a long way.",
