    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 58 days of using the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar in Kolkata, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—leaves a subtle cooling comfort on the skin during muggy afternoons, and over the past 3 weeks it super gentle on reactive skin that gets itchy from heavily perfumed market soaps. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Kolkata, and a little product goes a long way.",
