    "title": "A grounded 3-week breakdown from Balasore: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 60 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Balasore, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—no weird sugary syrup base or artificial flavoring—just pure tulsi ark, and over the past 3 weeks it way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Balasore, and a little product goes a long way. Knocking off one star only because the courier took 4 days to reach Balasore, though the product itself is spot on.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 60 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Balasore, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—no weird sugary syrup base or artificial flavoring—just pure tulsi ark, and over the past 3 weeks it way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Balasore, and a little product goes a long way. Knocking off one star only because the courier took 4 days to reach Balasore, though the product itself is spot on.",
