    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 4 weeks here in Banjara Hills",
    "body": "Living in Banjara Hills, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while pairing this internally with my skincare routine genuinely calmed my stress breakouts. Even better, the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop. My parents now guard this dropper bottle like family treasure every morning at 7 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Banjara Hills with a verifiable batch code. What is the best age for kids to take 1-2 diluted drops in water?",
    "comment": "Living in Banjara Hills, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while pairing this internally with my skincare routine genuinely calmed my stress breakouts. Even better, the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop. My parents now guard this dropper bottle like family treasure every morning at 7 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Banjara Hills with a verifiable batch code. What is the best age for kids to take 1-2 diluted drops in water?",
