    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-DAILY-01",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 6 weeks here in Jorhat",
    "body": "Living in Jorhat, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the golden gel texture glides on gently and leaves skin bouncy and hydrated, while my face looks noticeably brighter after three weeks of morning use. Even better, gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Jorhat with a verifiable batch code. Will you be launching a matching Sea Buckthorn leave-on serum to layer after this?",
    "comment": "Living in Jorhat, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the golden gel texture glides on gently and leaves skin bouncy and hydrated, while my face looks noticeably brighter after three weeks of morning use. Even better, gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Jorhat with a verifiable batch code. Will you be launching a matching Sea Buckthorn leave-on serum to layer after this?",
