    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 3-week breakdown from Midnapore: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 54 days of using the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar in Midnapore, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—no synthetic dye runoff or overpowering deodorant-style fragrance, and over the past 3 weeks it doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Midnapore, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 54 days of using the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar in Midnapore, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—no synthetic dye runoff or overpowering deodorant-style fragrance, and over the past 3 weeks it doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Midnapore, and a little product goes a long way.",
