    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 8 weeks here in Kalimpong",
    "body": "Living in Kalimpong, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. My parents now guard this dropper bottle like family treasure every morning at 7 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kalimpong with a verifiable batch code. Do you recommend taking this on an empty stomach or after breakfast?",
    "comment": "Living in Kalimpong, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. My parents now guard this dropper bottle like family treasure every morning at 7 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kalimpong with a verifiable batch code. Do you recommend taking this on an empty stomach or after breakfast?",
