    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 54 days of using the Activated Charcoal Face Wash in Junagadh, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—even one pump is enough after riding through dusty streets, and over the past 7 weeks it calmed down my stress breakouts around the jawline within a couple of weeks. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Junagadh, and a little product goes a long way.",
