    "body": "Living in Puri, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar 6 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it natural herbal fragrance that feels like an authentic home-crafted bath bar, while you can actually tell there are no harsh synthetic detergents in the base. Even better, the neem, tulsi, and aloe combination keeps skin cool, clean, and hydrated. My grandmother approved the neem-tulsi blend, which is the highest certification in our house.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Puri with a verifiable batch code. Do you use cold-pressed neem extract in this bar as well? Giving 4 stars since I'd love a larger family-size refill pack next time, otherwise zero complaints in Puri.",
    "comment": "Living in Puri, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar 6 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it natural herbal fragrance that feels like an authentic home-crafted bath bar, while you can actually tell there are no harsh synthetic detergents in the base. Even better, the neem, tulsi, and aloe combination keeps skin cool, clean, and hydrated. My grandmother approved the neem-tulsi blend, which is the highest certification in our house.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Puri with a verifiable batch code. Do you use cold-pressed neem extract in this bar as well? Giving 4 stars since I'd love a larger family-size refill pack next time, otherwise zero complaints in Puri.",
