    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 2 weeks here in Vijayawada",
    "body": "Living in Vijayawada, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 2 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it just 3 to 4 drops in warm water every morning completely settled my seasonal throat irritation, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. One tiny 30ml bottle outlasted three giant syrup bottles in our kitchen cabinet.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Vijayawada with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
