    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 6 weeks here in Kurseong",
    "body": "Living in Kurseong, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 6 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the golden gel texture glides on gently and leaves skin bouncy and hydrated, while the natural citrus-herbal aroma feels like a quick morning reset. Even better, wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent. Good to find a brightening wash that doesn't smell like a chemical candy shop.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kurseong with a verifiable batch code. Is this gentle enough to use twice a day during dry winter months?",
