    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar for 4 weeks here in Udhampur",
    "body": "Living in Udhampur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it pulls out summer grime and sunscreen residue while the aloe keeps skin soft, while lathers up smoothly even in our area's hard tap water. Even better, cleared up stubborn back acne and post-workout sweat congestion in a few weeks. Thought a handmade bar would vanish in a week, but this thing is built like a tank on a slotted dish.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Udhampur with a verifiable batch code. Do you offer a 3-bar or 4-bar value pack for families?",
