    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 8 weeks here in Kathua",
    "body": "Living in Kathua, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too. Even better, helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kathua with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
    "comment": "Living in Kathua, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while the glass dropper makes it super easy to carry in my work bag too. Even better, helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kathua with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
