    "title": "Why I stuck with the Activated Charcoal Face Wash for 6 weeks here in Darjeeling",
    "body": "Living in Darjeeling, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Activated Charcoal Face Wash 6 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it rinses off clean in seconds with zero stretchy or chalky feeling afterwards, while the 5% glycerin cushion really stops that post-wash dryness. Even better, calmed down my stress breakouts around the jawline within a couple of weeks. Bought this for my post-bike-ride dust, and now my brother uses half the bottle without asking.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Darjeeling with a verifiable batch code. Are you guys planning a 200ml pump bottle for this anytime soon?",
