    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 9-week breakdown from Panchkula: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 48 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Panchkula, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water, and over the past 9 weeks it great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Panchkula, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 48 days of using the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops in Panchkula, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water, and over the past 9 weeks it great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Panchkula, and a little product goes a long way.",
