    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar for 8 weeks here in Srinagar",
    "body": "Living in Srinagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gentle enough for daily showers without making my shoulders itch, while skin feels balanced and comfortable right out of the bathroom. Even better, pulls out summer grime and sunscreen residue while the aloe keeps skin soft. My dad tried one bar and immediately told me to order three more for the house.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Srinagar with a verifiable batch code. Can this also be used on the face in a pinch during travel?",
    "comment": "Living in Srinagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gentle enough for daily showers without making my shoulders itch, while skin feels balanced and comfortable right out of the bathroom. Even better, pulls out summer grime and sunscreen residue while the aloe keeps skin soft. My dad tried one bar and immediately told me to order three more for the house.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Srinagar with a verifiable batch code. Can this also be used on the face in a pinch during travel?",
