    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 4 weeks here in Hyderabad",
    "body": "Living in Hyderabad, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel, while my face looks noticeably brighter after three weeks of morning use. Even better, gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue. Finally look like I slept 8 hours even when I was up scrolling till 2 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Hyderabad with a verifiable batch code. Do you guys plan on releasing a bigger refill pack for daily users?",
    "comment": "Living in Hyderabad, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it gradually evened out my stubborn sun tan from daily outdoor travel, while my face looks noticeably brighter after three weeks of morning use. Even better, gives a soft, rested glow in the morning without any greasy residue. Finally look like I slept 8 hours even when I was up scrolling till 2 AM.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Hyderabad with a verifiable batch code. Do you guys plan on releasing a bigger refill pack for daily users?",
