    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 8 weeks here in Sambalpur",
    "body": "Living in Sambalpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Sambalpur with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
    "comment": "Living in Sambalpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while my throat feels clear and soothing right after my morning glass of water. Even better, tastes genuinely herbal and potent—one 30ml glass dropper bottle lasts our family over a month. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Sambalpur with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
