    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-VAULT-06",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 6 weeks here in Srinagar",
    "body": "Living in Srinagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home, while the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water. Even better, great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Srinagar with a verifiable batch code. Do you recommend taking this on an empty stomach or after breakfast?",
    "comment": "Living in Srinagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home, while the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water. Even better, great daily immunity support during monsoon and winter transitions for my parents. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Srinagar with a verifiable batch code. Do you recommend taking this on an empty stomach or after breakfast?",
