    "title": "A grounded 3-week breakdown from Kannur: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 30 days of using the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo in Kannur, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—it doesn't strip natural oils from the lengths like sulfate shampoos do, and over the past 3 weeks it cut down wash-day hair fall in the shower drain within three washes. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Kannur, and a little product goes a long way. Knocking off one star only because the courier took 4 days to reach Kannur, though the product itself is spot on.",
