    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo for 8 weeks here in Jayanagar",
    "body": "Living in Jayanagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 8 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it saves so much time on busy weekday mornings since I can skip conditioning, while massaging it in with water for two minutes gives a really clean, herbal wash. Even better, cleans out scalp sweat and light hair oil while keeping the ends soft. My husband started using it for his helmet-sweat scalp and now we need a second bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Jayanagar with a verifiable batch code. How many times a week do you recommend using this for an oily scalp?",
