    "body": "Living in Bikaner, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleans out scalp sweat and light hair oil while keeping the ends soft, while the rosemary and bhringraj blend smells genuinely earthy and calming. Even better, cut down wash-day hair fall in the shower drain within three washes. My comb and my shower drain are both having a much calmer month thanks to this bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Bikaner with a verifiable batch code. Any plans for a 500ml family pump bottle? We go through this pretty quick at home. Knocking off one star only because the courier took 4 days to reach Bikaner, though the product itself is spot on.",
    "comment": "Living in Bikaner, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleans out scalp sweat and light hair oil while keeping the ends soft, while the rosemary and bhringraj blend smells genuinely earthy and calming. Even better, cut down wash-day hair fall in the shower drain within three washes. My comb and my shower drain are both having a much calmer month thanks to this bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Bikaner with a verifiable batch code. Any plans for a 500ml family pump bottle? We go through this pretty quick at home. Knocking off one star only because the courier took 4 days to reach Bikaner, though the product itself is spot on.",
