    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-INSIDEOUT-02",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 4 weeks here in Alappuzha",
    "body": "Living in Alappuzha, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water. Even better, adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Alappuzha with a verifiable batch code. Is it okay to take this twice daily during heavy monsoon flu season?",
    "comment": "Living in Alappuzha, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Picked up the Inside-Out Skin-Clearing & Cortisol Ritual combo (Charcoal face wash, Charcoal bath bar, and the 7-Tulsi drops) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water. Even better, adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Alappuzha with a verifiable batch code. Is it okay to take this twice daily during heavy monsoon flu season?",
