    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-VAULT-06",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo for 4 weeks here in Vaishali Nagar",
    "body": "Living in Vaishali Nagar, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleans out scalp sweat and light hair oil while keeping the ends soft, while combing through wet hair after towel drying is way easier now. Even better, leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. My husband started using it for his helmet-sweat scalp and now we need a second bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Vaishali Nagar with a verifiable batch code. Any plans for a 500ml family pump bottle? We go through this pretty quick at home.",
