    "title": "A grounded 7-week breakdown from Puducherry: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 34 days of using the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar in Puducherry, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—my upper back and shoulders look noticeably clearer after three weeks, and over the past 7 weeks it eliminated body odor and sticky humidity feel way better than commercial bars. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Puducherry, and a little product goes a long way.",
