    "title": "Why I stuck with the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar for 4 weeks here in Nagpur",
    "body": "Living in Nagpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it pulls out summer grime and sunscreen residue while the aloe keeps skin soft, while it has a clean, grounded botanical scent that lingers lightly after a shower. Even better, doesn't melt into mush in three days like most handmade soaps if kept on a slotted dish. Post-gym showers hit different when your soap actually clears sweat instead of just masking it.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Nagpur with a verifiable batch code. Do you offer a 3-bar or 4-bar value pack for families?",
