    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 28 days of using the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo in Vapi, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—combing through wet hair after towel drying is way easier now, and over the past 5 weeks it leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Vapi, and a little product goes a long way.",
