    "body": "Living in Agra, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it cleans out scalp sweat and light hair oil while keeping the ends soft, while the rosemary and bhringraj blend smells genuinely earthy and calming. Even better, cut down wash-day hair fall in the shower drain within three washes. My husband started using it for his helmet-sweat scalp and now we need a second bottle.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Agra with a verifiable batch code. How many times a week do you recommend using this for an oily scalp?",
