    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 14 days of using the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar in Kothrud, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Most botanical products I tried earlier either smelled like artificial perfume or left a weird film behind.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—it has a clean, grounded botanical scent that lingers lightly after a shower, and over the past 5 weeks it leaves zero white chalky dryness on elbows and shins after bathing. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Kothrud, and a little product goes a long way. Took 5 days to arrive in Kothrud, but the packaging was neat and the formula easily earns its keep.",
