    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Aloe Vera, Neem & Tulsi Soothing Bar for 4 weeks here in Karnal",
    "body": "Living in Karnal, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the neem, tulsi, and aloe combination keeps skin cool, clean, and hydrated, while you can actually tell there are no harsh synthetic detergents in the base. Even better, doesn't dry out my skin even when showering twice a day in peak heat. Smells like a clean herb garden instead of the usual loud detergent perfume.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Karnal with a verifiable batch code. Is there a multi-bar family bundle for just the Aloe Neem Tulsi soap?",
    "comment": "Living in Karnal, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 4 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the neem, tulsi, and aloe combination keeps skin cool, clean, and hydrated, while you can actually tell there are no harsh synthetic detergents in the base. Even better, doesn't dry out my skin even when showering twice a day in peak heat. Smells like a clean herb garden instead of the usual loud detergent perfume.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Karnal with a verifiable batch code. Is there a multi-bar family bundle for just the Aloe Neem Tulsi soap?",
