    "combo_sku": null,
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 4 weeks here in Bhagalpur",
    "body": "Living in Bhagalpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while no weird sugary syrup base or artificial flavoring—just pure tulsi ark. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Bhagalpur with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
    "comment": "Living in Bhagalpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 4 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it helped calm my morning sneezing and weather-change congestion within two weeks, while no weird sugary syrup base or artificial flavoring—just pure tulsi ark. Even better, way more concentrated and authentic than the diluted 5-tulsi drops we used earlier. Used to wake up sneezing like clockwork every weather change—4 drops in warm water fixed that scene.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Bhagalpur with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
