    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-VAULT-06",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Charcoal Deep Cleansing Bar for 6 weeks here in Mumbai",
    "body": "Living in Mumbai, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Ordered the full 6-Piece Apothecary Vault for the house so everyone could pick their daily favorites 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it creamy, rich lather that feels refreshing after a long humid day outdoors, while my upper back and shoulders look noticeably clearer after three weeks. Even better, pulls out summer grime and sunscreen residue while the aloe keeps skin soft. Post-gym showers hit different when your soap actually clears sweat instead of just masking it.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Mumbai with a verifiable batch code. Can this also be used on the face in a pinch during travel?",
