    "combo_sku": "BV-BND-DAILY-01",
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Himalayan Sea Buckthorn Face Wash for 6 weeks here in Indore",
    "body": "Living in Indore, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the golden gel texture glides on gently and leaves skin bouncy and hydrated, while it rinses clean with zero slippery film left behind. Even better, keeps my combination skin comfortable from morning right through evening. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Indore with a verifiable batch code. Will you be launching a matching Sea Buckthorn leave-on serum to layer after this?",
    "comment": "Living in Indore, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar) 6 weeks ago, and it turned out to be the smartest routine change I have made this year.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the golden gel texture glides on gently and leaves skin bouncy and hydrated, while it rinses clean with zero slippery film left behind. Even better, keeps my combination skin comfortable from morning right through evening. My sister asked what I changed in my routine—obviously didn't gatekeep for long.\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Indore with a verifiable batch code. Will you be launching a matching Sea Buckthorn leave-on serum to layer after this?",
