    "body": "If you're switching from heavily perfumed commercial products in Varanasi, the earthy botanical smell of this sea buckthorn cleanser feels different at first. That said, after 9 days of use it wakes up dull morning skin with a fresh, natural botanical scent, and it never triggers redness around my nose the way foaming gels do. Solid everyday formula, just slightly on the premium side.",
