    "combo_sku": null,
    "rating": 5,
    "title": "Why I stuck with the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops for 8 weeks here in Kharagpur",
    "body": "Living in Kharagpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water. Even better, adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kharagpur with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
    "comment": "Living in Kharagpur, dealing with the mix of outdoor dust, humidity, and hard water made it tough to find a daily product that cleans properly without wrecking my barrier. I picked up the Kalpvriksh Satva 7-Tulsi Drops 8 weeks ago after reading how they disclose exact active percentages right on the bottle.\n\nFrom the first week of daily use, I noticed that it the amber glass dropper dispenses cleanly without leaking or wasting a single drop, while the 7-tulsi blend has a warm, peppery-clove botanical kick in lukewarm water. Even better, adding 3 drops to evening ginger tea has become a non-negotiable ritual at home. Warning: it's actually concentrated, so don't pour 10 drops like regular market tulsi water!\n\nEverything arrived securely packed in Kharagpur with a verifiable batch code. Can we mix 3 drops into lukewarm honey-lemon water in the morning?",
