    "rating": 5,
    "title": "A grounded 5-week breakdown from Bareilly: real results without the synthetic fluff",
    "body": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 60 days of using the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo in Bareilly, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—massaging it in with water for two minutes gives a really clean, herbal wash, and over the past 5 weeks it leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Bareilly, and a little product goes a long way.",
    "comment": "I rarely write long reviews, but after 60 days of using the Royal Botanical 2-in-1 Shampoo in Bareilly, I wanted to share a quick breakdown for anyone on the fence. Grabbed the Complete Botanical Daily Regimen combo (Sea Buckthorn face wash, 2-in-1 shampoo, and the Aloe-Neem-Tulsi bar), which made setting up a consistent morning and evening routine effortless.\n\nThis formulation is completely different—massaging it in with water for two minutes gives a really clean, herbal wash, and over the past 5 weeks it leaves my roots light and airy instead of weighed down by heavy silicones. My skin and hair feel noticeably calmer even on hectic commute days across Bareilly, and a little product goes a long way.",
